# Runtime + dev dependencies, mirroring python/pyproject.toml's
# [project.dependencies] and the dev extra. bandit and pip-audit are already in
# that extra. setuptools is pinned because dropping the old
# "--upgrade pip setuptools" step would otherwise freeze whatever the runner
# image ships, and pip-audit flags 79.0.1 for PYSEC-2026-3447. Compile with:
#   uv pip compile requirements/dev.in --generate-hashes --universal \
#     --python-version 3.11 -o requirements/dev.txt
